  (text "R1/R2 + C1/C2: one-pole low-pass, fc = 1/(2 pi R C) = 23 kHz. R sits at the DAC pin so the DAC's output" (at 122 101 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid afc712ef-835b-57fa-9408-787a7036343e))
  (text "amplifier never sees the capacitor directly (datasheet: 5 kohm min load, 50 pF max). C1/C2 should be C0G or film." (at 122 104 0)
